bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."},{"name":"Bewildering Burst","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74c6e8d0ff9596e2ea9b45073701b48b.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target causes the next hit to launch a Kinetic projectile that detonates into a disorienting blast."},{"name":"Lucky Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/05ff3c3914a333ff12abdea5782ceed9.png","desc":"Reloading after a precision final blow causes precision hits to refill a round from reserves."},{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Explosive Payload","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31f02e5f3bae68ecdfdd3f899cf931c7.png","desc":"Projectiles create an area-of-effect detonation on impact."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Adhesive Ordnance","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0f07b685b342c7354c29eb8cc06dec52.png","desc":"Collecting ammo loads an explosive round that adheres to surfaces, detonates shortly after impact, and applies exhaust."},{"name":"Kinetic Tremors","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/300c343e6c33651a74d8a3fe81536146.png","desc":"Sustained kinetic damage to a target emits a shockwave that damages any nearby targets."},{"name":"Precision Instrument","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e6a4ebc1a8a73e4c7fcfc21c69000ce2.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage increases precision damage."},{"name":"Redirection","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/062243c2875d9bbdc29aa115e1e299c5.png","desc":"Damaging rank-and-file combatants increases damage against more powerful ones."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight"